 {title:'A garden party in the clouds',text:'Dream up a soft, romantic look for a sunlit afternoon among the flowers.',mood:'Romantic',hint:'A Petal blouse, a floaty skirt, and something lilac feel just right.',target:{look:'blouse',bottom:'skirt',extra:'flower',palette:'lilac'},tag:'THE DAILY EDIT · 01'},
 {title:'A little gallery opening',text:'Make an artsy, polished impression at a tiny gallery tucked away downtown.',mood:'Artful',hint:'Try a Muse blazer, wide-leg pants, a pearl detail, and a thoughtful color.',target:{look:'jacket',bottom:'trousers',extra:'pearls',palette:'sage'},tag:'THE DAILY EDIT · 02'},
 {title:'Picnic under the stars',text:'The sky is turning pink. Put together a playful look for a cozy evening outside.',mood:'Playful',hint:'A Daydream dress, a tiny bow, and a rosewater finish are made for this.',target:{look:'dress',bottom:'pleats',extra:'bow',palette:'rose'},tag:'THE DAILY EDIT · 03'},
 {title:'Saturday at the flower market',text:'Build a cheerful, comfy look for picking up blooms and wandering all morning.',mood:'Easygoing',hint:'Garden overalls, daisy pins, and a sunny pop make a perfect market morning.',target:{look:'overalls',bottom:'shorts',extra:'flower',palette:'butter'},tag:'THE DAILY EDIT · 04'}
